{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "button",
    "version": "2.2.0",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "interactive",
      "control"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": ""
    },
    "layer": "atom",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [
        "scss/scss/05-atoms/_button.scss"
      ],
      "story": "stories/atoms/button.stories.js",
      "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/RecipeArena.vue",
      "drupal": [],
      "docs": "docs/button-docs.html"
    },
    "changelog": [
      {
        "version": "2.2.0",
        "changes": [
          "06.10.2026: Verhalten fuer den Umschaltknopf (Entscheidung 06.10.2026) — neo-behaviors `button` bindet nur .nc-button--toggle: Klick, Enter, Leertaste (nativer Klick) schalten aria-pressed um, gesperrte Knoepfe (disabled, aria-disabled) bleiben unveraendert; Ereignis button-toggle { pressed, value }. Arena: „Ausprobieren“ fuer den Toggle."
        ]
      },
      {
        "version": "2.1.0",
        "changes": [
          "06.10.2026: Toggle — Modifier nc-button--toggle an jedem Knopf (Outline-Basis, aria-pressed=true in Primaerfarben), Wrapper nur nc-button-group: nc-button-group--toggle gibt es im SCSS nicht, ohne nc-button--toggle blieb der gedrueckte Knopf unsichtbar.",
          "06.10.2026: domNotes — Loading braucht den Modifier nc-button--loading (zeichnet den Spinner) zusaetzlich zu aria-busy.",
          "06.10.2026: Arena aus dem Recipe (RecipeArena, Vorlage arena-templates/button.js) statt ButtonArena.vue (Plan v3, Phase 3)."
        ]
      },
      {
        "version": "2.0.0",
        "changes": [
          "29.09.2026: Token-Gruppe icon-button entfernt — Tokens stehen in der Gruppe icon (SCSS-Abschnitt), doppelte IDs aufgeloest."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-button"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "icon",
        "element": ".nc-button__icon",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "label",
        "element": ".nc-button__label",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "spinner",
        "element": ".nc-button__spinner",
        "optional": true
      }
    ],
    "domNotes": [
      "Buttons muessen immer ein zugaengliches Label haben — entweder sichtbarer Text oder aria-label fuer Icon-Only.",
      "Spinner (.nc-button__spinner) wird im State 'loading' angezeigt und blockiert Interaktion: Modifier .nc-button--loading plus aria-busy='true' — erst der Modifier zeichnet den Spinner.",
      "XS/SM Buttons haben unsichtbaren ::before Touch-Target (44px Minimum, WCAG 2.5.8).",
      "Loading nutzt visibility:hidden statt opacity:0 — Label-Breite bleibt erhalten, kein Layout-Shift."
    ]
  },
  "api": {
    "elements": {
      "default": {
        "element": "button",
        "attributes": [
          "type=button"
        ]
      },
      "link": {
        "element": "a",
        "attributes": [
          "href?"
        ]
      }
    },
    "attributes": [
      {
        "name": "disabled",
        "appliesTo": [
          "button"
        ],
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      {
        "name": "aria-disabled",
        "appliesTo": [
          "a"
        ],
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      {
        "name": "aria-busy",
        "appliesTo": [
          "button",
          "a"
        ],
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      {
        "name": "aria-pressed",
        "appliesTo": [
          "button",
          "a"
        ],
        "type": "boolean"
      },
      {
        "name": "aria-label",
        "appliesTo": [
          "button",
          "a"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "variant": {
      "label": "Variant",
      "description": "Visuelle Variante / Semantik des Buttons",
      "values": {
        "primary": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "primary"
          ]
        },
        "secondary": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--secondary",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "secondary"
          ]
        },
        "accent": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--accent",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "accent"
          ]
        },
        "outline": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--outline",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "outline"
          ]
        },
        "ghost": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--ghost",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "ghost"
          ]
        },
        "soft": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--soft",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "soft"
          ]
        },
        "inverted": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--inverted",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "inverted"
          ]
        },
        "success": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--success",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "success"
          ]
        },
        "warning": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--warning",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "warning"
          ]
        },
        "error": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--error",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "error"
          ]
        },
        "info": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--info",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "info"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "size": {
      "label": "Size",
      "description": "Groessenabstufung des Buttons",
      "values": {
        "xs": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--xs",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "size-scale",
            "touch-target"
          ]
        },
        "sm": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--sm",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "size-scale",
            "touch-target"
          ]
        },
        "md": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": []
        },
        "lg": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--lg",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "size-scale"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "pattern": {
      "label": "Pattern",
      "description": "Render-Muster / Slot-Konfiguration",
      "values": {
        "standard": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "label": true
          }
        },
        "with-icon": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "icon-sizing"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "icon": true,
            "label": true
          }
        },
        "icon-only": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--icon-only",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "icon-sizing"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "icon": true,
            "label": false
          },
          "renderHint": "icon-only"
        }
      }
    },
    "width": {
      "label": "Width",
      "description": "Breitenverhalten des Buttons",
      "values": {
        "auto": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": []
        },
        "full": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--full-width",
          "tokenGroups": []
        }
      }
    },
    "composition": {
      "label": "Composition",
      "description": "Kompositions-/Verwendungsform",
      "values": {
        "single": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": []
        },
        "group": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "button-group",
          "wrapper": {
            "element": "div",
            "className": "nc-button-group",
            "attributes": {
              "role": "group",
              "aria-label": "Aktionen"
            }
          }
        },
        "toggle": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--toggle",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "toggle",
          "wrapper": {
            "element": "div",
            "className": "nc-button-group",
            "attributes": {
              "role": "group",
              "aria-label": "Formatierung"
            }
          }
        },
        "fab": {
          "modifier": "nc-button--fab",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "fab"
          ],
          "renderHint": "fab",
          "slotConfig": {
            "icon": true,
            "label": false
          }
        },
        "link": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "elementHint": "a",
          "renderHint": "link"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "hover",
      "active",
      "focus-visible",
      "disabled",
      "loading",
      "pressed"
    ],
    "precedence": [
      "loading",
      "disabled",
      "pressed",
      "active",
      "hover",
      "focus-visible",
      "default"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "loading",
        "effects": [
          "blockInteraction"
        ],
        "attributes": {
          "aria-busy": true,
          "aria-disabled": true
        },
        "slotConfig": {
          "spinner": true
        },
        "tokenGroups": [
          "spinner"
        ],
        "note": "Loading hat Vorrang vor disabled — Spinner bleibt primaere Information."
      },
      {
        "state": "disabled",
        "effects": [
          "blockInteraction"
        ],
        "attributes": {
          "disabled?": true,
          "aria-disabled": true
        },
        "tokenGroups": [
          "disabled"
        ]
      },
      {
        "state": "pressed",
        "onlyWhen": {
          "axes": {
            "composition": [
              "toggle"
            ]
          }
        },
        "attributes": {
          "aria-pressed": "true|false"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "a11y": {
    "base": {
      "interactive": true,
      "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
      "focusIndicator": "focus-ring mixin, :focus-visible",
      "assertions": [
        "hasAccessibleName",
        "focusIndicatorVisible"
      ],
      "note": "Buttons muessen immer ein zugaengliches Label haben — entweder sichtbarer Text oder aria-label fuer Icon-Only."
    },
    "overrides": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "pattern": [
              "icon-only"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label"
        ],
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Icon-Only Buttons benoetigen immer aria-label. Quadratische Flaeche fuer einfaches Treffen."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "size": [
              "xs",
              "sm"
            ]
          }
        },
        "note": "XS/SM erhalten ::before Touch-Target (44px) fuer WCAG 2.5.8 Target Size."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "composition": [
              "group"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "role=group",
          "aria-label=Aktionen"
        ],
        "note": "Button-Group benoetigt role='group' mit aria-label. Mittlere Buttons haben keinen Radius."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "composition": [
              "toggle"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-pressed"
        ],
        "note": "Toggle-Buttons muessen aria-pressed verwenden. Aktiver Zustand kann zu Primary-Farben wechseln (Resolver-Regel)."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "composition": [
              "fab"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label"
        ],
        "note": "FAB benoetigt aria-label da kein sichtbarer Text vorhanden. Elevation-Shadow signalisiert interaktive Flaeche."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "composition": [
              "link"
            ]
          }
        },
        "note": "Links als Buttons gestylt benoetigen role='button' und Keyboard-Handling, wenn sie keine Navigation ausloesen."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "variant": [
              "inverted"
            ]
          }
        },
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Inverted-Buttons auf dunklen Hintergruenden — Kontrast gegen den tatsaechlichen Hintergrund pruefen, nicht gegen Surface."
      }
    ]
  },
  "constraints": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "pattern": [
              "icon-only"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label"
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "composition": [
              "fab"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label"
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "states": [
            "loading"
          ]
        },
        "effects": [
          "blockInteraction"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Loading-Buttons blockieren Interaktion. Loading hat Vorrang vor disabled."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "composition": [
              "toggle"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-pressed"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "copy": {
      "label": {
        "minChars": 1,
        "note": "Button-Labels sollten kurz und handlungsorientiert sein (z.B. 'Speichern', 'Abbrechen')."
      }
    }
  },
